  "dcterms:title": "PDAA \u2014 Phthalates Data Aggregation and Analysis (Insilica LLC / EMBSI)",
  "dcterms:description": "The Phthalates Data Aggregation and Analysis (PDAA) project, developed by Insilica LLC in collaboration with EMBSI (ExxonMobil Biomedical Sciences), aggregating and analysing phthalate data for developmental and reproductive toxicity. Its DVC pipeline processes client-provided EMBSI Excel files (resources/embsi/*.xlsx: DNT and reprotox endpoint extractions) into parquet, builds a ZINC-derived phthalate compound set, and enriches it with ChemHarmony properties, PubTator mentions, and AOP-Wiki associations. The most restrictive component \u2014 the proprietary EMBSI-provided data and the redistribution-restricted ZINC compounds \u2014 governs.",
